    {
      "source": "The servlet and all filters involved in an async request must have async\nsupport enabled using the Servlet API or by adding an\n<code>&lt;async-supported&gt;true&lt;/async-supported&gt;</code> element to servlet and filter\ndeclarations in <code>web.xml</code>.",
      "translation": "servlet 和所有涉及的异步请求的过滤器必须通过 Servlet API 启用异步支持，或者在 `web.xml` 中的 servlet 和过滤器声明中添加 `<code>&lt;async-supported&gt;true&lt;/async-supported&gt;</code>` 元素。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "It is important to avoid use of request and response objects after async\nprocessing has completed. Servlet containers often re-use them.",
      "translation": "避免在异步处理完成后使用请求和响应对象非常重要。Servlet 容器通常会复用这些对象。",
      "count": 2
    },
