      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether the request is in async mode following a call to <a href=\"AsyncWebRequest.html#startAsync()\"><code>AsyncWebRequest.startAsync()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "是否在调用 `<a href=\"AsyncWebRequest.html#startAsync()\"><code>AsyncWebRequest.startAsync()</code></a>` 后，请求处于异步模式。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether the request is in async mode following a call to <a href=\"AsyncWebRequest.html#startAsync()\"><code>AsyncWebRequest.startAsync()</code></a>.\nReturns \"false\" if asynchronous processing never started, has completed,\nor the request was dispatched for further processing.",
      "translation": "是否在调用 `<a href=\"AsyncWebRequest.html#startAsync()\"><code>AsyncWebRequest.startAsync()</code></a>` 后请求处于异步模式。如果异步处理从未开始、已完成，或请求已分发以进行进一步处理，则返回 \"false\"。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new instance for the given request/response pair.",
      "translation": "为给定的请求/响应对创建一个新的实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add a handler to invoke when request processing completes.",
      "translation": "添加一个处理器，在请求处理完成时调用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add a handler to invoke when an error occurred while concurrent\nhandling of a request.",
      "translation": "添加一个处理器，在并发处理请求时发生错误时被调用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add a handler to invoke when concurrent handling has timed out.",
      "translation": "添加一个处理器，在并发处理超时时被调用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Dispatch the request to the container in order to resume processing after\nconcurrent execution in an application thread.",
      "translation": "将请求分派到容器中，以便在应用程序线程中的并发执行后恢复处理。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "In Servlet 3 async processing, the timeout period begins after the\ncontainer processing thread has exited.",
      "translation": "在 Servlet 3 异步处理中，超时时间从容器处理线程退出后开始计算。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Mark the start of asynchronous request processing so that when the main\nprocessing thread exits, the response remains open for further processing\nin another thread.",
      "translation": "标记异步请求处理的开始，以便当主处理线程退出时，响应仍保持打开状态以供其他线程进一步处理。",
      "count": 2
    },
